    "name": "Crimson Moon",
    "steam_appid": 2360350,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360350/extras/65e947e5cab604ad6cf87b0cd73c81e1.poster.avif?t=1733151607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360350/extras/65e947e5cab604ad6cf87b0cd73c81e1.webm?t=1733151607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360350/extras/65e947e5cab604ad6cf87b0cd73c81e1.mp4?t=1733151607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ken, a high school student, is suddenly swallowed into another world, and he decides to take desperate action to rescue his younger sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this strange world illuminated by the red moon, a terrible tragedy unfolds....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense search and a battle to the death await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love the survival horror of yesteryear, this is a gem of a game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Search]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the main element of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny of the dungeon to find clues that will lead you to the next step in order to open up the blood path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles deplete your HP and weapons, so collect items in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the dungeon is filled with danger. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying aberrations roam the dungeon and you must overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you encounter an enemy, it is not easy to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Combat]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a turn-based battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you will be faced with the choice of defeating the enemy and obtaining items, or running away to save wear and tear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you choose to run away, it does not mean that you will be able to escape for sure. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encountering enemies in this game is a big risk in itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Fear System]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the fear system, which is a distinctive system, there is a &quot;fear gauge&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fear gauge reaches its maximum, allies are put into a state of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this happens, defenses are greatly reduced for several turns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle becomes overwhelmingly disadvantageous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before or after this happens, the fear must be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this, you need an item called a &quot;talisman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The talisman can be used during or outside of battle and will completely eliminate the fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear can also be eliminated by using the &quot;spring water&quot; in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that the fear gauge is also raised when you encounter &quot;terrible events&quot; in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Nanomachines]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the protagonist obtains an ability called a nanomachine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once this ability is released, the protagonist will be able to use special skills in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of skills consumes Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy is zero at the beginning of the battle and increases with the passage of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ability will be most effective when dealing with tough enemies.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360350/extras/65e947e5cab604ad6cf87b0cd73c81e1.poster.avif?t=1733151607\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360350/extras/65e947e5cab604ad6cf87b0cd73c81e1.webm?t=1733151607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360350/extras/65e947e5cab604ad6cf87b0cd73c81e1.mp4?t=1733151607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ken, a high school student, is suddenly swallowed into another world, and he decides to take desperate action to rescue his younger sister.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this strange world illuminated by the red moon, a terrible tragedy unfolds....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A tense search and a battle to the death await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who love the survival horror of yesteryear, this is a gem of a game experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Search]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the main element of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every nook and cranny of the dungeon to find clues that will lead you to the next step in order to open up the blood path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles deplete your HP and weapons, so collect items in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the dungeon is filled with danger. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying aberrations roam the dungeon and you must overcome them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you encounter an enemy, it is not easy to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Combat]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is a turn-based battle system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So you will be faced with the choice of defeating the enemy and obtaining items, or running away to save wear and tear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you choose to run away, it does not mean that you will be able to escape for sure. ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encountering enemies in this game is a big risk in itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Fear System]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the fear system, which is a distinctive system, there is a &quot;fear gauge&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the fear gauge reaches its maximum, allies are put into a state of fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this happens, defenses are greatly reduced for several turns,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battle becomes overwhelmingly disadvantageous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before or after this happens, the fear must be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To do this, you need an item called a &quot;talisman.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The talisman can be used during or outside of battle and will completely eliminate the fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear can also be eliminated by using the &quot;spring water&quot; in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note that the fear gauge is also raised when you encounter &quot;terrible events&quot; in the dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Nanomachines]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the protagonist obtains an ability called a nanomachine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once this ability is released, the protagonist will be able to use special skills in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The use of skills consumes Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy is zero at the beginning of the battle and increases with the passage of turns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This ability will be most effective when dealing with tough enemies.</p>",
    "short_description": "Isekai survival horror RPG. defeat the enemy or escape, your decision will make the difference between life and death. ...... A horror RPG with large character dots and a death-defying storyline.",
